@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization

@*
    Every page in this folder is part of the product and needs a signed-in person.

    PageAuthorizationTests fails the build for any routable page that declares neither
    [Authorize] nor [AllowAnonymous], so a page added here cannot end up reachable by accident
    (D-1 in docs/security-register.md).
*@
@attribute [Authorize]
